30-e30","summary":"Bolas reveals that Liliana's pact defaults to its broker, himself, when her demons die, and he threatens that disobedience will kill her.","participants":["nicol-bolas","liliana-vess"],"location":"the-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30","order":197,"story_date":"2018-05-30","storyline":"Dominaria","source":"wizards","paragraph":197,"quote":"You seem unaware that with your demons dead, your contract defaults to its broker.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30#:~:text=You%20seem%20unaware%20that,defaults%20to%20its%20broker.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Return to Dominaria: Episode 12","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Martha Wells"],"date":"2018-05-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30#:~:text=You%20seem%20unaware%20that,defaults%20to%20its%20broker.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Return to Dominaria: Episode 12\" by Martha Wells. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 May 2018."}},{"id":"return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30-e31","summary":"Bolas planeswalks away and Liliana follows, resolved to find an escape while staying alive.","participants":["nicol-bolas","liliana-vess"],"location":"the-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30","order":197,"story_date":"2018-05-30","storyline":"Dominaria","source":"wizards","paragraph":204,"quote":"Sick at heart, bound like a prisoner to a new incarnation of a fate she had schemed so long to cheat, Liliana followed in his wake.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30#:~:text=Sick%20at%20heart%2C%20bound,followed%20in%20his%20wake.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"